entries[446982] = { ["name"] = "Concoctor's Clutch", ["text"] = "2 sec cast 2\nReagents:\nOptional Reagents:\nEmbroidery Thread (#333)\nVendor:\nKhaz Algar World Vendors\nCost:\n150\n1500\n\nConcoctor's Clutch\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\n36 Slot Bag\nEquip: Increases the chance Algari experimentations discover a new recipe by 3%.\n\n[ Equip effect requires Khaz Algar Alchemy 1 ][ Equip effect requires Khaz Algar Alchemy 1 ]68\n\"Taut threads perfectly protect its inhabitants from experiments gone wrong.\"" }
